or_address}}"}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"4"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sureties"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not applicable unless named here. The Debtor is liable for the Debt."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"5"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Cause of the debt"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Moneys lent and advanced, or goods or services supplied, under the agreement between the Creditor and the Debtor, as reflected on the Creditor’s statement of account."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"6"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Calculation of the capital amount"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Balance handed over on {{handover_date}}: {{balance_handover}}. Plus interest to {{today}}: {{interest_accrued}}. Plus fees and expenses, including VAT of {{fees_vat}}: {{fees_total}}. Less payments received: {{paid_to_date}}. Capital amount: {{balance}}"}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"7"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Amounts excluded"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Fees and expenses prescribed in Annexure B to the Debt Collectors Act 114 of 1998, and VAT on them, incurred after the signature date. These are charged on the account as they arise."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"8"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Repayment"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"{{ptp_amount}} {{ptp_frequency}}, beginning on {{ptp_date}}, until the capital amount, interest and costs have been paid in full."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"9"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Interest"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"{{interest_rate}} on the outstanding balance from {{interest_from}}, calculated daily and compounded monthly, subject to the in duplum rule."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"10"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Default period"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"7 (seven) days from the due date of any instalment."}]}],[{"spans":[{"text":"11"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Payment"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Into the trust account of {{firm_name}}: {{firm_bank}}. Account name: {{firm_bank_holder}}. Account number: {{firm_bank_account}}. Reference: {{case_number}}"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"text":"HOW WE WILL REACH YOU"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"These are the details we will use. Correct any that are wrong before you sign, and leave blank anything you do not have."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Cellphone number: {{debtor_mobile}}"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Work number: {{debtor_work_phone}}"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Home number: {{debtor_home_phone}}"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Email address: {{debtor_email}}"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Employer: {{debtor_employer}}"}]},{"kind":"pagebreak"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"text":"PART B — TERMS AND CONDITIONS"}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Background. The Creditor supplied the goods, services or credit described in item 5 of Part A to the Debtor, and the Debtor has not paid for all of it. The account has been handed to the Creditor’s agent for collection. The Debtor has asked for time to pay, and the Creditor is prepared to accept payment in instalments on these terms and against the security recorded here."}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"text":"INTERPRETATION"}],"numbered":true},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"In this agreement, Business Day means any day other than a Saturday, Sunday or official public holiday in the Republic of South Africa; Capital Amount means the amount in item 6 of Part A; Debt means the Capital Amount together with all interest, fees, costs and other amounts payable under this agreement; Instalment means a payment set out in item 8 of Part A; and Signature Date means the date on which the party signing last signs."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Clause headings are for convenience only. The singular includes the plural, and “including” is not a word of limitation. If Part A and Part B conflict, Part A prevails."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"The rule that a contract is interpreted against the party who drafted it does not apply."}]},{"kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"text":"Where the National Credit Act 34 of 2005 applies 